               <title>PRINCIPAL DISPLAY PANEL - 120 mL Bottle Carton</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>NDC 68788-8286-1</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Compare to the<br/>active ingredient<br/>in Children's Claritin<sup>®</sup>*</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>Original<br/>Prescription Strength</paragraph>
